### 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "KAKAO",
  "accessToken": "replace-with-kakao-access-token"
}

### 내 정보 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/members/me
Authorization: Bearer replace-with-access-token

### 내 정보 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/members/me
Authorization: Bearer replace-with-access-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "누커"
}

### 프로필 이미지 업로드 URL 발급
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/members/me/profile-image-upload
Authorization: Bearer replace-with-access-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentType": "image/jpeg"
}

### 프로필 이미지 업로드
PUT replace-with-upload-url
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./profile.jpg

### 프로필 이미지 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/members/me
Authorization: Bearer replace-with-access-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profileImageUrl": "https://cdn.example.com/profile-images/7/replace-with-object.jpg"
}

### 회원 탈퇴
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/members/me
Authorization: Bearer replace-with-access-token
